sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / Client
    participant KubeAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Webhook as odh-model-controller<br/>Webhook Server<br/>9443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Controller as odh-model-controller<br/>Operator
    participant MSAPI as model-serving-api<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS
    participant OCP as OpenShift APIs<br/>(Routes, APIServer)

    rect rgb(230, 240, 255)
        Note over KubeAPI,Controller: Flow 1: Model Serving Resource Reconciliation
        User->>KubeAPI: kubectl apply InferenceService
        KubeAPI->>Webhook: POST /mutate-serving-kserve-io-v1beta1-inferenceservice<br/>TLS, Kubernetes Admission
        Webhook-->>KubeAPI: Mutated AdmissionReview
        KubeAPI->>Webhook: POST /validate-serving-kserve-io-v1beta1-inferenceservice<br/>TLS, Kubernetes Admission
        Webhook-->>KubeAPI: Validated AdmissionReview
        KubeAPI-->>User: InferenceService created

        KubeAPI-)Controller: Watch event: InferenceService<br/>HTTPS/6443, ServiceAccount token
        Controller->>KubeAPI: Create Service, ServiceAccount<br/>HTTPS/6443, ServiceAccount token
        Controller->>KubeAPI: Create NetworkPolicy, ClusterRoleBinding<br/>HTTPS/6443, ServiceAccount token
        Controller->>KubeAPI: Create KEDA TriggerAuthentication<br/>HTTPS/6443, ServiceAccount token
        Controller->>OCP: Create OpenShift Route<br/>HTTPS/6443, ServiceAccount token
        Controller->>KubeAPI: Create PodMonitor, ServiceMonitor<br/>HTTPS/6443, ServiceAccount token
    end

    rect rgb(230, 255, 230)
        Note over User,MSAPI: Flow 2: Gateway Discovery API
        User->>MSAPI: GET /api/v1/gateways<br/>HTTPS/8443, Bearer Token
        MSAPI->>MSAPI: Auth Middleware validates Bearer token
        MSAPI->>KubeAPI: SelfSubjectAccessReview<br/>HTTPS/6443, ServiceAccount token
        KubeAPI-->>MSAPI: Access decision
        MSAPI->>KubeAPI: List Gateway resources<br/>HTTPS/6443, ServiceAccount token
        KubeAPI-->>MSAPI: Gateway list
        MSAPI-->>User: JSON gateway response
    end

    rect rgb(255, 240, 230)
        Note over User,Controller: Flow 3: Admission Webhook Processing
        User->>KubeAPI: kubectl apply LLMInferenceService
        KubeAPI->>Webhook: POST /mutate-serving-kserve-io-v1alpha2-llminferenceservice<br/>TLS, Kubernetes Admission
        Webhook->>KubeAPI: Lookup referenced resources<br/>HTTPS/6443, ServiceAccount token
        KubeAPI-->>Webhook: Resource data
        Webhook-->>KubeAPI: Mutated AdmissionReview (defaults set)
        KubeAPI-->>User: LLMInferenceService created
    end

    rect rgb(245, 230, 255)
        Note over Controller,OCP: Flow 4: TLS Profile Watch
        OCP-)Controller: Watch event: APIServer TLS profile change
        Controller->>Controller: Resolve new TLS config<br/>(cipher suites, min version)
        Controller->>Controller: Graceful shutdown & restart
    end
